+	 * the BIT23 (=CM3_FAULT) we mistook for an "ack" through v13, which is why GX
+	 * never powered (v13: gx_gdsc on=0, sptprac 0xd4 => GX_HM off). davinci's
+	 * gx_arc_votes are unknown, so try the minimal vote (0) + OPTION=0 and report
